[54.027533, "o", "  Shape 3 (Content Placeholder 2): 'The paper presents Foam - Agent, a multi - agent framework automating CFD workflows from natural language. It features unique retrieval, file - generation and error - correction systems, lowering expertise barriers.'\r\n"]
[54.028291, "o", "    Top: 1825625, Left: 838200\r\n"]
