[54.029257, "o", "    Top: 365125, Left: 838200\r\n"]
[54.029485, "o", "  Shape 3 (Content Placeholder 2): 'ReAct, a method for prompting large language models in a way that enables them to both reason about problems as well as operate by producing predefined actions which have external effects (e.g. interact with a wikipedia API, or take some action in some simulated text-based environment).\\xa0'\r\n"]
